From fdb71fe741556c6803ec681f858738c16f99b682 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 10:27:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] add hardening toggles menu

add a 'Hardening' submenu to TrebleApp with toggles for security
hardening features that may cause vendor compatibility issues on
GSI builds:

- memory tagging for vendor processes (persist.sys.phh.gos.mte_vendor)
- hardened thread stacks (persist.sys.phh.gos.stack_hardening)

all toggles default to off for maximum compatibility. each requires
a reboot to take effect.
